e chance to begin again farther downstream.\\n\\nWhen night covered the valley, the town quieted. Under the stars, the river became a silver thread, winding toward an unseen horizon. It carried no speeches, yet it connected farms, forests, houses, and people who might never meet. Listening to its steady voice, I understood that a river is more than water traveling toward the sea. It is a living passage, gathering stories as it goes, and reminding everyone near its banks that movement can be a form of belonging.'''\\nprint(len(text.split()))\\nPY\",\"max_output_tokens\":1000,\"yield_time_ms\":10000}); text(r.output);", "status": "completed"}], "error": null, "incomplete_details": null, "tool_choice": "auto", "parallel_tool_calls": false, "prompt_cache_key": "01a159c2-d110-7ad2-8199-682dcc6a7f72", "prompt_cache_retention": "24h", "prompt_cache_options": {"ttl": "30m", "mode": "implicit", "comparison_response_id": "resp_07f6106a40a44a50016ad77dadd14c8198b1034b261d930d44"}, "prompt_cache_diagnostics": {"type": "unavailable"}, "text": {"format": {"type": "text"}, "verbosity": "low"}, "top_p": 0.98, "top_logprobs": 0, "temperature": 1.0, "reasoning": {"effort": "medium", "context": "all_turns", "summary": null, "mode": "standard"}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 19854, "input_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 19584, "cache_write_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 578, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 140}, "total_tokens": 20432, "attribution": {"items": {"amsg_01a159c2-f04c-78e1-8104-18546fab8673": {"input_tokens": 74, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}, "at_c83eda16-35d2-5e47-ba2a-467234fb72f3": {"input_tokens": 6908, "cached_tokens": 6908, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}, "ctc_07f6106a40a44a50016ad77dafe5f081988b10ab6e598849f5": {"input_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 438}, "msg_01a159c2-f047-7bf2-8fe9-6d7a3df2684a": {"input_tokens": 6738, "cached_tokens": 6738, "cache_write_tokens"